  "description": "Operating Area: Corsica, French Riviera & Monaco, Italy - North (mainland), Italy - Sardinia, Italy - Sicily, Italy - South (mainland), Provence Coast & Marseille\n\nAlkimia was launched in 2015 and thoughtfully refitted in 2025, offering a refreshed and inviting setting for life at sea. With accommodation for up to 10 guests in 4 cabins and a professional crew of 3 on board, every detail is in place for a seamless and relaxed charter experience.\n\nHer generous 45 sqm cockpit flows naturally into a bright, open saloon, creating a space that feels easy, open, and connected to the surroundings. Large panoramic windows fill the interiors with light throughout the day, while comfortable seating areas invite guests to unwind, gather, or simply take in the view.\n\nLife onboard this Sunreef 74 is all about balance –  from slow mornings at anchor to relaxed evenings shared with friends and family, with each space designed to feel both comfortable and effortlessly refined.",
